#: source/release-notes/rl-2.16.md:1
msgid "Release 2.16 (2023-05-31)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.16.md:3
msgid ""
"Speed-up of downloads from binary caches. The number of parallel downloads "
"(also known as substitutions) has been separated from the [`--max-jobs` "
"setting](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-max-jobs). The new setting is "
"called [`max-substitution-jobs`](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-max-"
"substitution-jobs). The number of parallel downloads is now set to 16 by "
"default (previously, the default was 1 due to the coupling to build jobs)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.16.md:8
msgid ""
"The function [`builtins.replaceStrings`](../language/builtins.md#builtins-"
"replaceStrings) is now lazy in the value of its second argument `to`. That "
"is, `to` is only evaluated when its corresponding pattern in `from` is "
"matched in the string `s`."
msgstr ""
